WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:14.740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.551
So...

00:01:19.551 --> 00:01:21.498
Care for a cup of coffee?

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:22.958
I'm good, it's late.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:25.206
Then at least have some cold water.

00:01:25.206 --> 00:01:27.223
You must be wiped out.

00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:36.091
He's not exactly a feather.

00:01:36.091 --> 00:01:38.838
You're stronger than you look.

00:01:38.838 --> 00:01:40.720
I just roll with whatever comes.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.555
Thanks for the water.

00:01:46.828 --> 00:01:49.977
Ki Jun and I share a place.

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:53.010
I figured.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.191
Don't read into it.

00:01:54.191 --> 00:01:57.237
I'm just crashing here for a bit because of some stuff going on.

00:01:57.237 --> 00:02:00.448
Ki Jun's only a friend to me.

00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:02.763
For now, anyway.

00:02:02.763 --> 00:02:05.553
We dated briefly way back.

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:08.284
Got it.

00:02:10.342 --> 00:02:11.584
Thanks for the water.

00:02:11.584 --> 00:02:13.602
Sorry for stopping by so late.

00:02:38.236 --> 00:02:40.357
Joo In Ah, what are you doing?

00:02:40.947 --> 00:02:42.882
Snap out of it.

00:02:48.454 --> 00:02:51.831
[Episode 6: Is it off the table?]

00:02:53.342 --> 00:02:54.919
Noh Ki Jun, get up.

00:02:54.919 --> 00:02:57.255
Be ready in ten and I'll put you in a cab.

00:02:57.255 --> 00:03:00.216
My head's killing me.

00:03:00.216 --> 00:03:02.759
How did I even get home last night?

00:03:02.759 --> 00:03:04.570
You just...

00:03:05.925 --> 00:03:08.041
walked in nice and easy.

00:03:08.725 --> 00:03:11.811
That homing instinct never fails.

00:03:11.811 --> 00:03:13.145
Nailed it.

00:03:13.145 --> 00:03:14.872
Good job.

00:03:18.276 --> 00:03:20.006
Drop me off up there.

00:03:20.006 --> 00:03:21.545
You take it the rest of the way.

00:03:21.545 --> 00:03:23.305
It's fine.

00:03:23.305 --> 00:03:25.633
Just ride up to the office with me.

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:27.545
What's the occasion?

00:03:27.545 --> 00:03:29.245
Hey, no complaints from me.

00:03:29.245 --> 00:03:31.263
Okay.

00:03:39.881 --> 00:03:41.674
Ms. Joo.

00:03:41.674 --> 00:03:43.442
Morning.

00:03:44.239 --> 00:03:45.986
Morning.

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:52.743
Did you make it home okay last night?

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:56.831
We had a team dinner thing going on.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:02.362
Thanks to you, I made it home fine.

00:04:02.362 --> 00:04:05.131
- How are you... - Ki Jun.

00:04:11.955 --> 00:04:13.264
What's this about?

00:04:13.264 --> 00:04:16.350
Acting all sloppy in front of your boss.

00:04:16.964 --> 00:04:19.145
Don't you think, Ms. Joo?

00:04:20.412 --> 00:04:21.525
Hard to say.

00:04:21.525 --> 00:04:23.691
Sloppy is pretty much his default with me.

00:04:31.384 --> 00:04:33.200
What's wrong with you?

00:04:40.248 --> 00:04:41.939
What's gotten into Secretary Park?

00:04:41.939 --> 00:04:43.618
Did she eat something weird?

00:04:43.618 --> 00:04:46.364
You heard about Manager Do over at Cosmetics, right?

00:04:46.364 --> 00:04:47.407
Yes.

00:04:47.407 --> 00:04:49.739
I'm tacking on assault and bodily harm to the PM violation

00:04:49.739 --> 00:04:51.378
and revisiting the disciplinary level.

00:04:51.378 --> 00:04:54.104
On top of that, several clients are calling out his behavior

00:04:54.104 --> 00:04:55.290
and pulling their contracts.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.750
We're talking serious numbers.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.258
Loop in Legal and start looking at termination.

00:04:59.258 --> 00:05:01.421
Yes, will do.

00:05:01.421 --> 00:05:04.318
By the way, are you feeling all right?

00:05:04.318 --> 00:05:06.458
Shouldn't you rest a little?

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:07.979
- Maybe take a half-day... - I'm fine.

00:05:07.979 --> 00:05:09.278
I said I'm fine.

00:05:09.278 --> 00:05:11.193
You think I'd be the youngest female executive

00:05:11.193 --> 00:05:14.398
if I burned a half-day every time I had a few drinks?

00:05:14.398 --> 00:05:16.061
I'm Joo In Ah.

00:05:16.061 --> 00:05:18.579
A little thing like this

00:05:23.902 --> 00:05:26.272
never throws me off, ever.

00:05:27.113 --> 00:05:28.756
Right.

00:05:30.825 --> 00:05:32.676
That earns my respect.

00:05:52.883 --> 00:05:56.351
Yes, looking great.

00:05:56.351 --> 00:05:58.676
Last one.

00:05:58.676 --> 00:06:00.843
That's a wrap.

00:06:00.843 --> 00:06:02.607
You're working so hard.

00:06:02.607 --> 00:06:04.901
The shots are coming out really sharp.

00:06:04.901 --> 00:06:05.938
What time?

00:06:05.938 --> 00:06:07.911
Oh, just past nine.

00:06:07.911 --> 00:06:09.463
What?

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.426
- I'm leaving. - Hey, where are you going?

00:06:13.426 --> 00:06:15.131
Wrap it up yourself, my girl's waiting.

00:06:15.131 --> 00:06:17.231
There's still a few setups to go.

00:06:17.231 --> 00:06:18.330
PK.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.474
Where are you going?

00:06:42.925 --> 00:06:44.183
What should we do later?

00:06:44.183 --> 00:06:46.363
What do you feel like?

00:06:46.363 --> 00:06:48.403
Just stay still for now.

00:06:48.403 --> 00:06:52.073
Hold on, I'm driving.

00:06:59.676 --> 00:07:01.243
- One second. - What?

00:07:01.243 --> 00:07:02.750
We've got time, just a second.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:03.764
Kiss me.

00:07:03.764 --> 00:07:06.684
- I'm driving. - You stopped.

00:07:06.684 --> 00:07:08.144
- I'll give you plenty later. - No.

00:07:08.144 --> 00:07:08.904
- Stay still. - Hang on.

00:07:08.904 --> 00:07:11.108
Just a second, seriously.

00:07:14.592 --> 00:07:16.405
What the hell?

00:07:20.134 --> 00:07:21.426
What was that?

00:07:21.426 --> 00:07:23.579
You're dead.

00:07:28.134 --> 00:07:29.444
Step on it.

00:07:29.444 --> 00:07:31.800
He's getting away.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.300
He's not stopping.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.549
This is so much fun.

00:07:59.328 --> 00:08:00.669
You're not going to pull over?

00:08:00.669 --> 00:08:02.529
How dare you take a photo of...

00:08:02.529 --> 00:08:04.828
I said pull over!

00:08:12.676 --> 00:08:13.946
Damn it.

00:08:13.946 --> 00:08:16.676
Oh, come on.

00:08:16.676 --> 00:08:18.759
- What the heck? - What is it?

00:08:21.217 --> 00:08:23.305
This is unbelievable.

00:08:24.134 --> 00:08:25.333
Is he okay?

00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:27.467
Get out of the car.

00:08:27.467 --> 00:08:29.686
Damn it, seriously.

00:08:30.299 --> 00:08:32.590
<i>Singer slash actor and top star PK</i>

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.301
[Top Star PK, Late-Night Chase] <i>got into a wreck downtown last night,</i>

00:08:35.301 --> 00:08:36.969
<i>and the backlash is huge.</i>

00:08:36.969 --> 00:08:39.175
<i>Investigations show it was not a simple mishap.</i>

00:08:39.175 --> 00:08:41.132
[Brands Cut Ties with PK, Massive Penalty Fees] <i>He intentionally went after the other vehicle</i>

00:08:41.132 --> 00:08:42.759
<i>and hit it,</i>

00:08:42.759 --> 00:08:45.227
["PK's Midnight Pursuit"] <i>which is making the whole thing way worse.</i>

00:08:45.227 --> 00:08:47.384
<i>Just the breach fees from advertisers alone</i>

00:08:47.384 --> 00:08:50.483
[PK Stays Quiet on Road Rage] <i>could reach into the tens of millions,</i>

00:08:50.483 --> 00:08:53.627
<i>and the entire industry is buzzing over it.</i>

00:08:54.487 --> 00:08:55.759
Seriously.

00:08:55.759 --> 00:08:57.823
PK...

00:08:57.823 --> 00:08:59.968
What were you thinking?

00:08:59.968 --> 00:09:02.636
With a face like this?

00:09:05.957 --> 00:09:07.349
Are you a PK fan?

00:09:07.349 --> 00:09:09.509
Yes, she's a die-hard fan.

00:09:09.509 --> 00:09:13.388
Anytime PK was on a flyer, I'd snag it for her.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.945
So he's done as our spokesmodel, right?

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.549
Sir.

00:09:25.549 --> 00:09:28.192
Let me go get some sugar in me,

00:09:28.192 --> 00:09:29.800
since I can't bring myself to work.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:33.417
Yeah, go on. Take a breather and reset.

00:09:38.967 --> 00:09:42.243
What's a grown adult doing fawning over celebs?

00:09:42.243 --> 00:09:43.612
Don't you think, Da Ye?

00:09:43.612 --> 00:09:45.373
I guess people get like that.

00:09:45.373 --> 00:09:47.613
You don't have any celebrity crushes?

00:09:47.613 --> 00:09:51.002
Please, Da Ye doesn't bother with that stuff.

00:09:51.002 --> 00:09:52.468
You think she got into SNU for free?

00:09:52.468 --> 00:09:53.753
The CPA exam doesn't pass itself.

00:09:53.753 --> 00:09:56.132
- True. - She just buckled down and studied.

00:09:56.132 --> 00:09:57.532
Never got distracted.

00:09:57.532 --> 00:09:59.300
Right?

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.355
Look at her.

00:10:00.355 --> 00:10:02.592
We're talking about her, and she's tuning us out,

00:10:02.592 --> 00:10:04.558
just locked in on her work.

00:10:04.558 --> 00:10:05.736
That's a future big shot.

00:10:05.736 --> 00:10:07.534
Honestly, I'm jealous.

00:10:15.693 --> 00:10:17.904
[A new message has arrived from Assistant Manager Shin Ji Hye in Marketing]

00:10:20.342 --> 00:10:23.133
<i>Got a second, Ki Jun?</i>

00:10:25.077 --> 00:10:26.830
The invitation came out nice.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.575
Congrats on the wedding.

00:10:28.575 --> 00:10:30.870
Means a lot.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.800
Hey, listen.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.313
I owe you an apology.

00:10:36.923 --> 00:10:41.177
Remember the stairwell,

00:10:41.177 --> 00:10:43.654
when I jumped you?

00:10:45.807 --> 00:10:48.310
Marriage blues, like you said.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.397
I'm a whole new person now.

00:10:51.397 --> 00:10:53.134
I'll give my husband everything I've got.

00:10:53.134 --> 00:10:55.191
Smart call.

00:10:55.191 --> 00:10:57.501
Wishing you the best.

00:10:58.426 --> 00:11:00.571
How's the planning going?

00:11:00.571 --> 00:11:02.574
Work's burying me right now.

00:11:02.574 --> 00:11:04.780
Need it all wrapped before the wedding.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:08.854
The PK mess, right?

00:11:08.854 --> 00:11:11.541
Swapping out the model's no joke.

00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:12.708
No,

00:11:12.708 --> 00:11:14.294
PK stays.

00:11:14.294 --> 00:11:17.005
- Stays? - Hold for now, per the lead.

00:11:17.005 --> 00:11:19.799
Investigation's open, see how it lands.

00:11:19.799 --> 00:11:22.955
Image is the whole thing for a model, no?

00:11:22.955 --> 00:11:24.721
Beats me.

00:11:24.721 --> 00:11:27.855
Overseas, PK still moves the needle.

00:11:28.676 --> 00:11:30.309
Honestly,

00:11:30.309 --> 00:11:32.139
makes no sense to me.

00:11:32.139 --> 00:11:34.397
Has PK got someone backing him?

00:11:34.397 --> 00:11:36.123
Huh?

00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:46.203
Anyway, congrats. See you at the wedding.

00:11:48.259 --> 00:11:49.412
Hey.

00:11:49.412 --> 00:11:51.246
Out on a meeting?

00:11:51.246 --> 00:11:52.999
Slow day for you, Noh?

00:11:52.999 --> 00:11:56.135
Coffee runs on the clock, must be nice.

00:11:56.135 --> 00:11:58.895
Coffee's just cover for intel gathering.

00:11:58.895 --> 00:12:01.016
Just reeled one in, actually.

00:12:01.016 --> 00:12:02.856
Whether it's a PM case, that's what we need to dig into.

00:12:02.856 --> 00:12:05.777
My gut never misses on these.

00:12:07.426 --> 00:12:09.156
Spit it out.

00:12:11.092 --> 00:12:12.993
You know PK, right?

00:12:19.818 --> 00:12:24.735
Last five years, every model contract we've signed.

00:12:26.991 --> 00:12:28.951
Stage reports too, not just the deals.

00:12:28.951 --> 00:12:31.203
Minutes, internal reviews, quotes.

00:12:31.203 --> 00:12:34.342
Email threads, the works, all in there.

00:12:34.342 --> 00:12:38.519
Comb it line by line and flag anything off.

00:12:38.519 --> 00:12:40.421
But I just meant about PK...

00:12:40.421 --> 00:12:42.700
You've got a bias against PK already.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.810
That's how you end up forcing the puzzle.

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:47.762
Shouldn't we compare the PK issue

00:12:47.762 --> 00:12:50.170
with the others to get the full picture?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.570
Don't you think?

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.701
[As Soon As Possible] Make it ASAP.

00:13:01.026 --> 00:13:04.513
[Document List]

00:13:07.426 --> 00:13:10.435
Told you a hundred times, not going.

00:13:10.435 --> 00:13:13.551
Bunch of old guys flexing, why bother?

00:13:13.551 --> 00:13:15.331
This was on the calendar a month back.

00:13:15.331 --> 00:13:18.945
Big room tonight, ease up on the booze.

00:13:18.945 --> 00:13:20.555
Bit late for that.

00:13:20.555 --> 00:13:22.771
Already six drinks deep.

00:13:27.886 --> 00:13:30.639
This is an addiction.

00:13:30.639 --> 00:13:32.489
Let's get you help.

00:13:38.896 --> 00:13:41.187
Sorry, didn't mean to laugh.

00:13:45.883 --> 00:13:47.546
What's up?

00:13:49.741 --> 00:13:51.573
Scared?

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.886
Worried I'll crack like your mom did?

00:14:04.964 --> 00:14:07.607
Quit looking at me like that.

00:14:11.342 --> 00:14:14.539
Drop the damn look!

00:14:46.217 --> 00:14:47.513
Ma'am.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.092
Aren't the kids waiting on pickup?

00:14:50.092 --> 00:14:51.903
Right, I should head out.

00:14:51.903 --> 00:14:53.865
You head out first.

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.303
Wedding prep's brutal, isn't it?

00:14:56.303 --> 00:14:58.434
The list never ends.

00:14:58.434 --> 00:15:00.269
Let me know if you need any help.

00:15:00.269 --> 00:15:01.509
Thanks, I will.

00:15:01.509 --> 00:15:03.330
You can take off now.

00:15:04.342 --> 00:15:05.858
See you tomorrow.

00:15:05.858 --> 00:15:07.834
Have a good night.

00:15:17.453 --> 00:15:21.550
[P]

00:15:54.009 --> 00:15:56.560
What took you so long? Get over here.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.885
Do you know how long I've been waiting?

00:16:08.773 --> 00:16:11.600
Why are you heading back this late? Working overtime?

00:16:17.137 --> 00:16:18.862
Hey, why do you keep acting all chummy?

00:16:18.862 --> 00:16:20.808
You're the one who said don't acknowledge me at work.

00:16:20.808 --> 00:16:22.851
And yesterday, in front of Ms. Joo,

00:16:22.851 --> 00:16:24.861
you went and fixed my tie like this.

00:16:24.861 --> 00:16:26.362
I nearly had a heart attack.

00:16:26.362 --> 00:16:29.316
Why are you freaking out so much?

00:16:29.316 --> 00:16:31.557
Got some reason In Ah can't find out?

00:16:31.557 --> 00:16:33.221
About us?

00:16:33.221 --> 00:16:36.448
Look, let's just be careful around everyone, okay?

00:16:36.448 --> 00:16:38.453
Bad news.

00:16:38.453 --> 00:16:40.844
In Ah already knows.

00:16:42.342 --> 00:16:45.765
That we live together.

00:16:47.126 --> 00:16:48.454
Wait, what are you talking about?

00:16:48.454 --> 00:16:50.509
When you passed out drunk the other night,

00:16:50.509 --> 00:16:52.172
In Ah was the one who dropped you off.

00:16:52.172 --> 00:16:53.773
What?

00:16:56.467 --> 00:16:58.054
Why are you only telling me now?

00:16:58.054 --> 00:17:01.414
Didn't realize it was such a big deal.

00:17:04.226 --> 00:17:06.228
Hey, did you explain it properly? That there's nothing between us?

00:17:06.228 --> 00:17:08.940
Told her exactly how it is.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.126
That we used to date.

00:17:26.374 --> 00:17:28.632
What's up with her?

00:17:52.939 --> 00:17:54.800
Hey.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.737
You haven't headed home yet?

00:17:56.737 --> 00:17:59.032
Forgot something, came back to grab it.

00:17:59.032 --> 00:18:00.547
Done with this batch?

00:18:00.547 --> 00:18:02.242
Really, I can handle this on my own.

00:18:02.242 --> 00:18:05.136
Too much overtime pay hurts the company.

00:18:17.217 --> 00:18:19.407
Have you eaten?

00:18:19.407 --> 00:18:21.187
Want some of this?

00:18:21.187 --> 00:18:23.097
I'm good.

00:18:23.097 --> 00:18:24.474
Okay.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.673
You took me all the way home?

00:18:39.673 --> 00:18:42.716
Yeah. You should drop a few pounds.

00:18:43.693 --> 00:18:47.846
Well, it's all muscle, so the weight kind of...

00:18:58.757 --> 00:19:01.786
Secretary Park and I are just friends.

00:19:01.786 --> 00:19:03.220
Separate rooms,

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.737
and we barely cross paths since we're both busy.

00:19:05.737 --> 00:19:08.518
So it's more like a housemate situation...

00:19:08.518 --> 00:19:09.644
Hey,

00:19:09.644 --> 00:19:12.731
you don't need to break all that down for me.

00:19:12.731 --> 00:19:14.789
That's your personal life.

00:19:19.467 --> 00:19:22.357
You're not curious about my personal life?

00:19:22.357 --> 00:19:24.466
The guy who kissed you?

00:19:27.634 --> 00:19:29.465
Not curious.

00:19:29.465 --> 00:19:30.766
Drop it too.

00:19:30.766 --> 00:19:33.425
Weren't you supposed to play it cool?

00:19:33.425 --> 00:19:35.883
Then,

00:19:35.883 --> 00:19:38.146
how about answering my question?

00:19:39.864 --> 00:19:42.400
The reason you keep pushing me away.

00:19:48.534 --> 00:19:52.227
Asking whether I'm seeing someone?

00:19:52.227 --> 00:19:54.825
That sounds way too personal.

00:19:54.825 --> 00:19:56.399
We're working right now.

00:19:56.399 --> 00:19:57.900
Let's drop this here,

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:59.671
and keep things strictly work.

00:19:59.671 --> 00:20:01.795
What if it's a work question?

00:20:04.364 --> 00:20:06.341
What do you mean by that?

00:20:07.367 --> 00:20:10.232
How could my love life be work-related?

00:20:10.232 --> 00:20:11.955
It can be.

00:20:11.955 --> 00:20:14.709
Depends on the guy you're seeing.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.950
He's staying out all night?

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.969
[Model Casting Proposal]

00:22:15.925 --> 00:22:18.342
Even without bias, this looks shady.

00:22:18.342 --> 00:22:19.916
Group brand model PK,

00:22:19.916 --> 00:22:21.551
back in '20 for the first contract,

00:22:21.551 --> 00:22:24.646
got paid 300 million won when nobody knew his name.

00:22:25.922 --> 00:22:28.383
Then in '21, the renewal jumped straight to one billion.

00:22:28.383 --> 00:22:29.836
[A billion won]

00:22:30.552 --> 00:22:32.039
Doesn't seem like an issue, does it?

00:22:32.039 --> 00:22:33.407
He blew up in between.

00:22:33.407 --> 00:22:35.765
The figure lines up with model rates back then.

00:22:35.765 --> 00:22:38.310
- Coverage was pretty wide too. - Right.

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:40.313
That part checks out, but...

00:22:41.561 --> 00:22:44.107
between image fatigue and ongoing acting controversies,

00:22:44.107 --> 00:22:48.111
his stock is crashing right now, and yet...

00:22:48.111 --> 00:22:50.500
they renew him again at five billion won.

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:53.528
Even switching the terms to a three-year deal.

00:22:53.528 --> 00:22:56.695
This isn't getting played,

00:22:56.695 --> 00:23:00.223
this looks like someone got blackmailed.

00:23:02.175 --> 00:23:04.123
You know what's the sketchiest part?

00:23:04.123 --> 00:23:06.133
When renewal talks come up,

00:23:06.133 --> 00:23:08.841
other models have internal departments

00:23:08.841 --> 00:23:11.008
plus outside agencies and reps

00:23:11.008 --> 00:23:13.342
exchanging a massive amount of communication.

00:23:13.342 --> 00:23:15.555
But with PK,

00:23:15.555 --> 00:23:17.308
none of that shows up at all.

00:23:17.308 --> 00:23:19.476
No in-person agency meetings,

00:23:19.476 --> 00:23:22.979
zero emails between either side.

00:23:22.979 --> 00:23:25.175
If something that should be there isn't,

00:23:25.175 --> 00:23:28.550
that hints something else was going on instead.

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:30.169
Exactly.

00:23:31.698 --> 00:23:33.425
The thing is,

00:23:33.425 --> 00:23:35.658
how do we actually prove it?

00:23:35.658 --> 00:23:37.202
While you were going through the paperwork,

00:23:37.202 --> 00:23:40.413
I dug around PK's social media a bit.

00:23:40.413 --> 00:23:41.693
Sorry?

00:23:42.832 --> 00:23:44.627
You were having fun on your own?

00:23:44.627 --> 00:23:46.838
This must've been a blast.

00:23:46.838 --> 00:23:49.248
What're you saying? My eyes were about to fall out.

00:23:49.248 --> 00:23:50.883
Look at the veins popping.

00:23:50.883 --> 00:23:52.566
Where?

00:24:05.333 --> 00:24:06.900
Anyway,

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:10.255
PK posted a photo back in March '20.

00:24:11.634 --> 00:24:13.155
Here, this is the one.

00:24:13.155 --> 00:24:15.258
The place screams expensive,

00:24:15.258 --> 00:24:18.136
so I ran a search using this window as a clue,

00:24:18.136 --> 00:24:19.467
and it turns out to be a place in Osaka, Japan,

00:24:19.467 --> 00:24:22.874
a stupidly expensive private hot spring.

00:24:22.874 --> 00:24:26.342
He's a celebrity, so dates like this make sense.

00:24:26.342 --> 00:24:27.935
Sure.

00:24:29.129 --> 00:24:31.092
But of all times, right around then,

00:24:31.092 --> 00:24:34.013
the timing lines up too perfectly,

00:24:34.013 --> 00:24:37.504
one of our employees swiped the corporate card in Osaka.

00:24:37.504 --> 00:24:39.389
Charged it and canceled right after, sure,

00:24:39.389 --> 00:24:40.883
but whether guilt got to them

00:24:40.883 --> 00:24:42.684
or they were being careful not to leave a trail,

00:24:42.684 --> 00:24:45.036
that part I can't tell.

00:24:46.688 --> 00:24:48.133
Yeah, but...

00:24:48.133 --> 00:24:51.682
tons of Koreans travel there all the time,

00:24:51.682 --> 00:24:55.046
so it might just be a coincidence.

00:24:55.904 --> 00:24:58.007
But what if that Korean

00:24:59.784 --> 00:25:02.912
turned out to be the one calling shots on PK?

00:25:02.912 --> 00:25:05.014
Changes things, doesn't it?

00:25:08.001 --> 00:25:10.276
[Team Leader Han Ji Won]

00:25:21.067 --> 00:25:22.934
Trouble reading Korean?

00:25:22.934 --> 00:25:25.326
You're taking forever.

00:25:26.894 --> 00:25:28.813
[Standard Contract: Ad Model PK]

00:25:28.813 --> 00:25:30.023
No rush.

00:25:30.023 --> 00:25:31.300
Look it over carefully.

00:25:31.300 --> 00:25:33.209
Thank you.

00:25:40.217 --> 00:25:44.098
Every model gets picked by the book.

00:25:44.098 --> 00:25:45.883
With PK though,

00:25:45.883 --> 00:25:48.124
trust had built up over so many years,

00:25:48.124 --> 00:25:50.538
some corners might have gotten cut.

00:25:50.538 --> 00:25:52.238
And Japan?

00:25:52.238 --> 00:25:54.358
That part really was a coincidence.

00:25:54.358 --> 00:25:58.360
Took a family trip with the kids and their dad,

00:25:58.360 --> 00:26:00.303
and I mixed up my cards,

00:26:00.303 --> 00:26:02.651
swiped the corporate card at a convenience store by mistake

00:26:02.651 --> 00:26:04.573
and canceled right away.

00:26:05.600 --> 00:26:07.895
A family trip, huh?

00:26:07.895 --> 00:26:11.257
Mind if I see the photos from that trip?

00:26:11.257 --> 00:26:13.066
Yeah, I'd love to show you,

00:26:13.066 --> 00:26:15.028
but I switched phones recently,

00:26:15.028 --> 00:26:16.679
and none of the photos carried over.

00:26:16.679 --> 00:26:17.864
Gosh.

00:26:17.864 --> 00:26:20.158
You lost every single photo of your kids?

00:26:20.158 --> 00:26:22.617
And no cloud backup either?

00:26:22.617 --> 00:26:25.538
Right? Tech really isn't my thing.

00:26:25.538 --> 00:26:27.558
Hand over the phone.

00:26:27.558 --> 00:26:31.358
- Sorry? - I don't buy it, so unlock the phone.

00:26:31.358 --> 00:26:34.619
Am I actually required to do that?

00:26:34.619 --> 00:26:36.798
This is standard investigation procedure.

00:26:36.798 --> 00:26:39.384
You'll fill out and submit a consent form,

00:26:39.384 --> 00:26:42.869
and refusing is your right too.

00:26:42.869 --> 00:26:46.615
But nothing good comes out of that route.

00:26:49.060 --> 00:26:51.175
Family trip, my foot.

00:26:51.175 --> 00:26:52.550
What Korean mom would

00:26:52.550 --> 00:26:54.524
pull her firstborn out of school in March,

00:26:54.524 --> 00:26:57.962
right after first grade started, for a hot spring trip?

00:26:57.962 --> 00:27:00.683
Already know your husband didn't go.

00:27:00.683 --> 00:27:02.756
Confirmed it all.

00:27:18.967 --> 00:27:20.774
Dating.

00:27:22.595 --> 00:27:24.406
PK and I,

00:27:26.592 --> 00:27:28.657
we're a couple.

00:27:38.717 --> 00:27:41.683
Team Leader Han caved way too easily.

00:27:41.683 --> 00:27:44.282
The background check pegged her as stubborn

00:27:44.282 --> 00:27:46.951
and tough-minded,

00:27:46.951 --> 00:27:49.803
so I had a few more interview scripts ready.

00:27:50.830 --> 00:27:52.556
Busy tonight?

00:28:07.599 --> 00:28:09.406
Oh my.

00:28:25.925 --> 00:28:27.660
Min Yul, sit up straight.

00:28:27.660 --> 00:28:31.050
- Buckle up properly. - Let me grab it.

00:28:31.050 --> 00:28:33.430
- Got it. - Dong Yoon, you're here.

00:28:35.258 --> 00:28:38.060
Hey, not even saying hi to your mom?

00:28:39.509 --> 00:28:41.855
Kids, no running.

00:28:43.008 --> 00:28:44.845
Hey, off the game.

00:28:44.845 --> 00:28:46.382
Honey.

00:28:46.382 --> 00:28:47.428
I'm sorry.

00:28:47.428 --> 00:28:50.003
Barely escaped when the boss pushed for round two.

00:28:50.003 --> 00:28:53.534
- Good job. - Hey Dong Yoon, dad's right here and no hello?

00:28:55.217 --> 00:28:57.322
Hey, aren't these the dumplings you love?

00:28:57.322 --> 00:28:58.762
Can I try one?

00:28:58.762 --> 00:29:00.383
- Try one. - No thanks.

00:29:00.383 --> 00:29:02.391
- Just try it. - Stop it.

00:29:05.905 --> 00:29:07.699
Marriage looks rock solid for them.

00:29:07.699 --> 00:29:09.118
Sure does.

00:29:09.118 --> 00:29:12.758
With this kind of schedule, where would Han find time to date?

00:29:12.758 --> 00:29:15.097
Thank you.

00:29:16.758 --> 00:29:19.518
Dong Yoon, drop the game already.

00:29:36.838 --> 00:29:38.839
Han really claims to be PK's girlfriend?

00:29:38.839 --> 00:29:40.148
And that's why she gave him special treatment?

00:29:40.148 --> 00:29:42.679
Is this one of those sponsor situations?

00:29:42.679 --> 00:29:44.652
Where would she even get that kind of money?

00:29:44.652 --> 00:29:47.160
Does a marketing leader pull way more than an audit leader?

00:29:47.160 --> 00:29:47.899
Not really.

00:29:47.899 --> 00:29:51.367
He kept saying work eats up all his time, no dating,

00:29:51.367 --> 00:29:55.121
acting all innocent like fans were his whole world.

00:29:55.121 --> 00:29:58.124
Look, I didn't swallow that line completely,

00:29:58.124 --> 00:30:00.298
but this still crosses a line, right?

00:30:00.298 --> 00:30:01.419
Seriously, how...

00:30:01.419 --> 00:30:04.733
could a married mom of three be his sponsor?

00:30:04.733 --> 00:30:08.067
Honestly, the embarrassment is mine.

00:30:14.474 --> 00:30:15.592
Da Ye, what's up?

00:30:15.592 --> 00:30:17.050
What're you doing?

00:30:17.050 --> 00:30:19.469
Why the sudden cleanup?

00:30:20.883 --> 00:30:23.013
- What... - Gosh.

00:30:25.509 --> 00:30:26.793
What's going on?

00:30:26.793 --> 00:30:28.962
- This is... - What's wrong with her?

00:30:30.092 --> 00:30:32.216
It's PK merch.

00:30:32.965 --> 00:30:35.509
So when PK had his accident,

00:30:35.509 --> 00:30:38.758
the passenger never got identified?

00:30:38.758 --> 00:30:40.875
Right, there's zero info out there,

00:30:40.875 --> 00:30:43.565
and reporters are pulling their hair out too.

00:30:43.565 --> 00:30:47.217
If Han is making it all up,

00:30:47.217 --> 00:30:48.424
why on earth?

00:30:48.424 --> 00:30:50.651
Getting caught means instant termination.

00:30:51.553 --> 00:30:54.182
Maybe something scares her more than getting fired.

00:31:00.217 --> 00:31:03.205
I told you, you shouldn't give it this much water.

00:31:04.673 --> 00:31:07.084
"I told you"?

00:31:07.902 --> 00:31:09.962
Excuse me, but isn't that a bit too casual?

00:31:13.115 --> 00:31:15.926
Short and sweet is a virtue, you know.

00:31:16.967 --> 00:31:18.762
Hey...

00:31:24.092 --> 00:31:26.297
The more I think about it, the weirder it gets.

00:31:26.297 --> 00:31:28.883
Han being PK's girlfriend, I mean.

00:31:28.883 --> 00:31:30.758
The women PK has dated,

00:31:30.758 --> 00:31:32.844
idol Ha Jung Yoon, actress Yang Hee Seung,

00:31:32.844 --> 00:31:35.274
hotel heiress Cho Moon Joo, influencer Lee Ji Hyun.

00:31:35.274 --> 00:31:36.931
Every one of them puppy-faced,

00:31:36.931 --> 00:31:39.832
petite and the cute type, right?

00:31:39.832 --> 00:31:42.103
But Han is super tall

00:31:42.103 --> 00:31:44.524
and totally cat-faced.

00:31:44.524 --> 00:31:46.818
On top of that, married.

00:31:46.818 --> 00:31:49.460
And not chaebol-level for the sponsor angle.

00:31:50.342 --> 00:31:51.990
Ms. Yoon,

00:31:51.990 --> 00:31:54.965
you know an awful lot about PK.

00:31:56.634 --> 00:31:59.128
Used to be a fan.

00:31:59.128 --> 00:32:01.263
Just quit the fandom now.

00:32:02.592 --> 00:32:05.559
Sounds like you were a hardcore fan.

00:32:06.217 --> 00:32:10.174
So anything come to mind?

00:32:10.174 --> 00:32:13.717
Rumors going around the fandom maybe,

00:32:13.717 --> 00:32:17.946
or some private social media account of PK's.

00:32:22.352 --> 00:32:25.271
There's a notorious stalker fan

00:32:25.271 --> 00:32:27.706
in the PK fandom.

00:32:28.300 --> 00:32:31.634
He posted threats claiming

00:32:31.634 --> 00:32:34.421
to have photos from the night of the accident.

00:32:36.411 --> 00:32:39.176
He might know something useful.

00:32:40.995 --> 00:32:42.855
[Stay strong PK, we've got your back]

00:32:54.384 --> 00:32:56.644
You're PK Rabbit, right?

00:32:56.644 --> 00:32:58.348
The hoodie gave you away.

00:32:58.348 --> 00:33:00.489
Cute rabbit, by the way.

00:33:02.008 --> 00:33:03.700
Gosh.

00:33:09.439 --> 00:33:12.918
I'm the one who sent the DM,

00:33:13.653 --> 00:33:15.841
about the photocard trade.

00:33:15.841 --> 00:33:18.524
Is it really a photocard trade?

00:33:18.524 --> 00:33:22.136
Not another big-corp person, right?

00:33:22.136 --> 00:33:25.472
I'm from a big corp, but how did you...

00:33:27.175 --> 00:33:28.592
Wait.

00:33:28.592 --> 00:33:30.419
What's wrong?

00:33:30.419 --> 00:33:33.522
What's wrong with you?

00:33:43.099 --> 00:33:46.483
The photos I handed over last time, that's everything.

00:33:46.483 --> 00:33:48.398
There aren't any copies.

00:33:48.398 --> 00:33:50.233
- And one more thing. - Yes.

00:33:50.233 --> 00:33:51.853
I'll quit the fandom.

00:33:51.853 --> 00:33:53.859
And no more taking those photos either.

00:33:53.859 --> 00:33:56.112
I'll stop chasing PK forever.

00:33:56.112 --> 00:33:58.364
- Hey, why're you doing this, get up. - So please just...

00:33:58.364 --> 00:34:01.467
- leave me alone, okay? - What in the world?

00:34:01.467 --> 00:34:03.217
- No. - This kind of thing is

00:34:03.217 --> 00:34:05.929
straight-up big-corp bullying.

00:34:19.300 --> 00:34:22.362
Which big corporation are you talking about?

00:34:25.185 --> 00:34:30.213
Aren't you from Sesan Group?

00:34:31.314 --> 00:34:33.332
Sesan Group?

00:34:35.092 --> 00:34:37.030
The original photo files.

00:34:37.030 --> 00:34:39.796
Confirmed no copies exist either.

00:34:47.258 --> 00:34:49.306
Nice work.

00:34:50.416 --> 00:34:52.267
Nailed it.

00:34:57.383 --> 00:35:02.903
Did you actually tell them we're dating?

00:35:04.930 --> 00:35:07.050
And they bought it?

00:35:07.050 --> 00:35:09.159
Bunch of idiots.

00:35:11.133 --> 00:35:13.942
I'll get your husband transferred to the Europe branch.

00:35:13.942 --> 00:35:15.791
Slip away quietly.

00:35:37.316 --> 00:35:40.440
They say a former fan turned hater is the worst.

00:35:42.300 --> 00:35:44.008
But seriously,

00:35:44.008 --> 00:35:46.175
I fangirled over PK for years right next to you,

00:35:46.175 --> 00:35:49.243
how did you never let it slip even once?

00:35:49.243 --> 00:35:50.909
Unbelievable.

00:35:51.903 --> 00:35:53.730
Da Ye.

00:35:53.730 --> 00:35:57.191
Making friends at work isn't your thing, I get it,

00:35:57.191 --> 00:35:59.459
but that was still pretty harsh.

00:36:08.496 --> 00:36:10.864
Isn't it fan club goods?

00:36:10.864 --> 00:36:13.495
And first generation, no less?

00:36:13.495 --> 00:36:15.509
The resale price on these is no joke.

00:36:15.509 --> 00:36:17.065
Tossing them is such a waste,

00:36:17.065 --> 00:36:18.225
who does that benefit?

00:36:18.225 --> 00:36:20.883
Sell them and treat yourself to tteokbokki at least.

00:36:20.883 --> 00:36:22.524
Right?

00:36:25.208 --> 00:36:26.637
Well...

00:36:26.637 --> 00:36:29.477
Today, my treat works too.

00:36:29.477 --> 00:36:31.934
I've already moved a few.

00:36:31.934 --> 00:36:34.036
Made me rich.

00:36:42.444 --> 00:36:44.629
Tteokbokki,

00:36:46.008 --> 00:36:48.008
how could I pass?

00:36:49.592 --> 00:36:51.386
Let's go.

00:36:52.580 --> 00:36:54.749
Hold up.

00:36:54.749 --> 00:36:56.250
What kind of tteokbokki do you like?

00:36:56.250 --> 00:36:57.606
Wheat cake or rice cake?

00:36:57.606 --> 00:36:59.925
Rice cake for me.

00:36:59.925 --> 00:37:01.257
Be straight with me.

00:37:01.257 --> 00:37:02.746
Spit it out honestly.

00:37:02.746 --> 00:37:05.925
Sounds like we share the same taste here.

00:37:05.925 --> 00:37:07.841
Pick up the ball.

00:37:07.841 --> 00:37:09.676
Someone could get hurt.

00:37:09.676 --> 00:37:11.531
Min Yul.

00:37:18.967 --> 00:37:20.816
So,

00:37:20.816 --> 00:37:22.876
any good with the ball?

00:37:24.883 --> 00:37:26.175
Hey.

00:37:26.175 --> 00:37:27.740
Got you!

00:37:27.740 --> 00:37:29.758
Hey, this...

00:37:31.634 --> 00:37:33.678
Pass it.

00:37:34.455 --> 00:37:35.531
What are you doing?

00:37:35.531 --> 00:37:37.717
- Help me out. - What're you doing?

00:37:37.717 --> 00:37:40.143
No way!

00:37:42.152 --> 00:37:44.031
Foul!

00:37:44.031 --> 00:37:46.634
Stop!

00:37:46.634 --> 00:37:48.384
Line up right here.

00:37:48.384 --> 00:37:51.092
Hey, dirty plays like that aren't okay, alright?

00:37:51.092 --> 00:37:53.142
Keep things fair.

00:37:53.142 --> 00:37:55.033
Right?

00:37:57.603 --> 00:38:00.624
Go have fun!

00:38:03.717 --> 00:38:05.794
My back.

00:38:13.745 --> 00:38:16.791
Three boys to raise plus a marketing lead role,

00:38:16.791 --> 00:38:19.099
Han, that's impressive.

00:38:21.710 --> 00:38:23.854
Dating on top of it all.

00:38:24.841 --> 00:38:26.982
No date tonight?

00:38:29.967 --> 00:38:31.723
He works at Sesan Group, right?

00:38:31.723 --> 00:38:33.446
Your husband.

00:38:35.009 --> 00:38:37.430
That must've turned into your weak spot.

00:38:37.430 --> 00:38:39.299
At our company maybe not,

00:38:39.299 --> 00:38:42.414
but her pull at Sesan can't be brushed aside.

00:38:52.217 --> 00:38:55.286
Looks like you came knowing everything.

00:38:55.286 --> 00:38:57.913
What's your move from here?

00:38:57.913 --> 00:38:59.164
What did they ask of you?

00:38:59.164 --> 00:39:00.960
Told me to ship out overseas.

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:03.923
Said they'd transfer my husband's posting.

00:39:03.923 --> 00:39:06.096
Once I'm gone,

00:39:06.096 --> 00:39:08.968
the case fizzles without a key party,

00:39:08.968 --> 00:39:11.568
and PK keeps the contract.

00:39:12.636 --> 00:39:14.509
The two lovebirds keep going strong,

00:39:14.509 --> 00:39:16.974
and you alone wind up

00:39:16.974 --> 00:39:21.077
the talk of the town as the sponsor who got busted and bolted abroad?

00:39:22.187 --> 00:39:25.167
Sounds like the makings of a legend.

00:39:26.361 --> 00:39:30.027
Joining at twenty-five and grinding for fifteen years

00:39:30.027 --> 00:39:32.214
amounts to nothing in the end?

00:39:32.965 --> 00:39:36.760
That level of gossip would actually be tame.

00:39:37.369 --> 00:39:39.800
Told them I'm a coworker friend of yours,

00:39:39.800 --> 00:39:41.865
the second kid Min Wook over there, right?

00:39:41.865 --> 00:39:43.805
Min Wook hit me with this.

00:39:43.805 --> 00:39:45.546
Asks if I'm friends with the chief then.

00:39:45.546 --> 00:39:49.005
Said his mom runs the show at work,

00:39:49.005 --> 00:39:53.258
told me not to give the chief grief and listen up.

00:39:53.258 --> 00:39:56.126
Looks out for his mom hard, even if listening's another story.

00:39:56.126 --> 00:39:57.574
Right?

00:39:58.182 --> 00:40:01.368
He keeps calling me "Chief"...

00:40:06.394 --> 00:40:08.208
Want some help?

00:40:12.634 --> 00:40:16.049
I make a pretty handy shield.

00:40:17.284 --> 00:40:19.254
Care to put me to use?

00:40:19.254 --> 00:40:20.935
I made a promise to the kids too,

00:40:20.935 --> 00:40:22.931
to keep the chief safe.

00:40:36.004 --> 00:40:37.304
Alright.

00:40:37.304 --> 00:40:39.258
All set, back in action.

00:40:39.258 --> 00:40:41.825
Square up for round two.

00:41:03.050 --> 00:41:05.598
My ball.

00:41:06.342 --> 00:41:07.384
Alright.

00:41:07.384 --> 00:41:09.686
Min Yul, pass it to me.

00:41:11.338 --> 00:41:14.091
The reason A was able to pressure marketing

00:41:14.091 --> 00:41:17.553
into giving Model B special treatment

00:41:17.553 --> 00:41:20.888
traces back to flaws in our ad production system.

00:41:21.704 --> 00:41:22.973
To address that, here are ways

00:41:22.973 --> 00:41:24.592
to tighten procedural transparency in model selection...

00:41:24.592 --> 00:41:26.703
Hold up.

00:41:27.563 --> 00:41:30.318
So who exactly is this A?

00:41:30.318 --> 00:41:32.359
Model B is clearly PK,

00:41:32.359 --> 00:41:34.124
but A's identity has to come out, right?

00:41:34.124 --> 00:41:35.284
Are you trying to kill us with suspense?

00:41:35.284 --> 00:41:37.030
The name itself isn't the core issue.

00:41:37.030 --> 00:41:39.384
Naming names also opens up defamation risk.

00:41:39.384 --> 00:41:42.024
Come on, are we strangers here?

00:41:42.024 --> 00:41:44.163
Defamation, really? That stings.

00:41:44.163 --> 00:41:47.523
Apologies for not laying out every detail,

00:41:47.523 --> 00:41:49.793
but if A's identity gets out,

00:41:49.793 --> 00:41:52.713
the corporate risk balloons even bigger,

00:41:52.713 --> 00:41:54.676
so please bear with me on this.

00:41:54.676 --> 00:41:59.527
Honestly, who is this person?

00:42:02.681 --> 00:42:04.224
Hyun Young.

00:42:04.224 --> 00:42:06.534
What brings you here?

00:42:13.384 --> 00:42:15.668
Which one of you is Joo In Ah?

00:42:34.023 --> 00:42:36.133
Who do you think you are, dropping PK?

00:42:36.133 --> 00:42:39.051
Who the hell do you think you are, you crazy bitch?

00:42:39.051 --> 00:42:40.179
Who are you to drop him?

00:42:40.179 --> 00:42:42.335
Who do you think you are, huh?

00:42:46.509 --> 00:42:48.050
What do you think you're doing?

00:42:48.050 --> 00:42:49.676
Let go.

00:42:49.676 --> 00:42:51.517
Let go!

00:42:51.517 --> 00:42:53.540
Let go!

00:43:00.823 --> 00:43:03.550
[Vice Chairman's Office]

00:43:04.358 --> 00:43:08.258
Jeon Jae Yeol, lost your mind? Huh?

00:43:08.258 --> 00:43:10.348
Answer me!

00:43:12.008 --> 00:43:13.839
Who are you people to drop PK?

00:43:13.839 --> 00:43:16.175
Who are you to lay a finger on him?

00:43:16.175 --> 00:43:17.918
Can't you hear me?

00:43:17.918 --> 00:43:21.092
Hey, give me an answer.

00:43:21.092 --> 00:43:23.445
Hey, answer me!

00:43:37.634 --> 00:43:39.592
Am I some kind of joke to you?

00:43:39.592 --> 00:43:42.550
Why blow up over something so small?

00:43:42.550 --> 00:43:45.761
You aren't jealous, are you?

00:43:45.761 --> 00:43:48.495
Have I ever said a word

00:43:48.495 --> 00:43:50.592
about who you see on the side?

00:43:50.592 --> 00:43:53.122
At the bare minimum, the company shouldn't get dragged in.

00:43:53.122 --> 00:43:55.380
Did I take a bribe? Did I do anything?

00:43:55.380 --> 00:43:58.521
You guys pull worse crap and still come at me.

00:43:59.381 --> 00:44:01.902
Could you say the same in front of your father?

00:44:01.902 --> 00:44:03.361
Just try it.

00:44:03.361 --> 00:44:05.300
I'll kill myself.

00:44:05.300 --> 00:44:07.470
Try.

00:44:07.470 --> 00:44:09.490
Take your shot if you can.

00:44:11.467 --> 00:44:13.645
You crossed the line

00:44:13.645 --> 00:44:15.958
this time, big-time.

00:44:17.676 --> 00:44:19.568
Pick a country and fly out immediately.

00:44:19.568 --> 00:44:22.253
Don't even think about coming back for a while.

00:44:48.013 --> 00:44:50.112
What kind of Head of Audit takes hits like this?

00:44:50.112 --> 00:44:53.060
Day after day getting beaten, banged up,

00:44:53.060 --> 00:44:54.830
cursed at.

00:44:55.479 --> 00:44:56.774
That really stings.

00:44:56.774 --> 00:44:59.374
Could you ease up and skip the feelings?

00:45:01.550 --> 00:45:02.989
Alright.

00:45:02.989 --> 00:45:04.486
Come closer.

00:45:09.425 --> 00:45:11.043
All done.

00:45:13.586 --> 00:45:15.713
That hurts.

00:45:15.713 --> 00:45:17.600
Such a baby.

00:45:19.467 --> 00:45:21.266
And what happened to your leg?

00:45:21.266 --> 00:45:23.467
One side bruised, the other cut up.

00:45:23.467 --> 00:45:24.549
Oh, this?

00:45:24.549 --> 00:45:27.384
The Son Heung Min of Mapo-dong slid into me.

00:45:27.384 --> 00:45:29.404
Wait, you play soccer too?

00:45:30.431 --> 00:45:32.560
You've got plenty of hobbies.

00:45:33.934 --> 00:45:35.386
Did you disinfect this at all?

00:45:35.386 --> 00:45:36.603
It's fine, leave it.

00:45:36.603 --> 00:45:38.621
This'll heal up in no time.

00:45:41.300 --> 00:45:43.418
Hold still a second.

00:45:51.300 --> 00:45:54.585
Models can't have marks on the body, you know that?

00:45:54.585 --> 00:45:56.764
Zero professionalism.

00:46:25.405 --> 00:46:28.151
About that question you asked...

00:46:31.450 --> 00:46:34.594
The real reason behind pushing you away.

00:46:40.883 --> 00:46:42.935
I...

00:46:50.230 --> 00:46:52.278
I...

00:47:03.634 --> 00:47:05.025
Mr. Noh.

00:47:05.025 --> 00:47:06.813
That woman who just left,

00:47:06.813 --> 00:47:08.461
Joo In Ah, right?

00:47:09.530 --> 00:47:10.752
Getting shot down again?

00:47:10.752 --> 00:47:12.840
It's nothing, get to work.

00:47:20.342 --> 00:47:22.800
Ms. Joo.

00:47:22.800 --> 00:47:25.395
Let me apologize on her behalf.

00:47:43.647 --> 00:47:45.194
[Non-Disclosure Agreement]

00:47:45.194 --> 00:47:49.318
This NDA covers staying quiet about what happened today.

00:47:49.318 --> 00:47:50.324
What for?

00:47:50.324 --> 00:47:53.156
Worried I'll run my mouth about the Vice Chairman's wife

00:47:53.156 --> 00:47:54.692
being a total psycho?

00:47:54.692 --> 00:47:56.550
Just covering the bases.

00:47:56.550 --> 00:47:59.467
Everyone who was there has to sign one.

00:47:59.467 --> 00:48:01.248
Don't read too much into it.

00:48:01.248 --> 00:48:03.641
Sign at the bottom.

00:48:08.050 --> 00:48:11.130
Bit of a surprise, right?

00:48:11.925 --> 00:48:15.800
On the surface, the Vice Chairman looks flawless.

00:48:15.800 --> 00:48:18.932
But once you peel it back...

00:48:18.932 --> 00:48:20.795
[Signed by Noh Ki Jun] His life's pretty rough.

00:48:23.717 --> 00:48:28.082
I guess everyone's carrying something.

00:48:29.258 --> 00:48:32.587
So is that what pulled you toward him?

00:48:34.841 --> 00:48:37.006
You knew this whole time?

00:48:37.006 --> 00:48:40.290
Hey, I can read a room.

00:48:40.290 --> 00:48:43.379
No wonder you handle PM.

00:48:43.379 --> 00:48:46.767
Joo In Ah really knows talent when she sees it.

00:48:49.080 --> 00:48:53.175
- It's over now, right? - Speaking of reading rooms...

00:48:53.175 --> 00:48:56.068
What's the deal between you and Joo In Ah?

00:48:57.300 --> 00:48:59.447
Is there something there?

00:49:03.883 --> 00:49:05.361
Hey, where are you running off to?

00:49:05.361 --> 00:49:07.830
Off to find out what we are.

00:49:16.198 --> 00:49:17.799
- Hey, Doo Gi. - Yes?

00:49:17.799 --> 00:49:19.050
Where did Ms. Joo go?

00:49:19.050 --> 00:49:20.399
She took half a day off.

00:49:20.399 --> 00:49:21.458
Crazy, right?

00:49:21.458 --> 00:49:23.676
She never uses a single day off all year.

00:49:23.676 --> 00:49:25.290
Something must be up.

00:49:25.290 --> 00:49:27.459
Put me down for a half day too.

00:49:27.459 --> 00:49:28.518
Do me a favor.

00:49:28.518 --> 00:49:30.144
Sorry?

00:49:31.299 --> 00:49:33.883
A half day, out of nowhere?

00:49:33.883 --> 00:49:37.485
<i>Your call has been forwarded to voicemail...</i>

00:50:05.330 --> 00:50:07.000
[Joo In Ah]

00:50:11.008 --> 00:50:15.147
<i>Your call has been forwarded to voicemail...</i>

00:50:20.967 --> 00:50:22.196
[Ms. Joo...]

00:50:31.022 --> 00:50:33.332
This is going to scar.

00:50:42.659 --> 00:50:44.077
[Reporting Head of Audit Joo In Ah]

00:50:44.077 --> 00:50:45.245
[Joo In Ah's carrying on an inappropriate relationship at work]

00:50:45.245 --> 00:50:46.359
[Attached is the proof]

00:50:50.050 --> 00:50:51.976
<i>No way...</i>

00:52:00.967 --> 00:52:02.880
Joo In Ah.

00:52:05.286 --> 00:52:07.551
Ms. Joo!

00:52:34.649 --> 00:52:36.315
[Revital Retreat]

00:52:52.873 --> 00:52:55.175
You made it, Ms. Joo.

00:52:55.175 --> 00:52:57.169
Bro, don't even get me started.

00:52:57.169 --> 00:52:58.434
She kept saying she wouldn't come.

00:52:58.434 --> 00:53:02.051
So I went to her place and basically dragged her here.

00:53:02.051 --> 00:53:03.899
Mr. Noh.

00:53:07.637 --> 00:53:10.432
Right, the one who did the presentation earlier.

00:53:10.432 --> 00:53:12.783
What brings you all the way out here?

00:53:13.433 --> 00:53:15.453
Well, the thing is...

00:53:17.425 --> 00:53:20.258
Something urgent came up for Ms. Joo.

00:53:20.258 --> 00:53:21.876
Yes.

00:53:27.073 --> 00:53:29.022
Now that's a dedicated employee.

00:53:29.022 --> 00:53:30.441
Impressive.

00:53:30.441 --> 00:53:31.870
All right, then.

00:53:31.870 --> 00:53:33.702
Take your time talking it through.

00:53:33.702 --> 00:53:35.322
We're about to eat anyway.

00:53:35.322 --> 00:53:37.250
He came all this way.

00:53:37.250 --> 00:53:38.841
Feed him some sashimi before he goes.

00:53:38.841 --> 00:53:39.961
Stay and eat.

00:53:39.961 --> 00:53:41.001
Will do.

00:53:41.001 --> 00:53:42.772
Shall we?

00:54:00.231 --> 00:54:03.318
This must be some executive event.

00:54:03.318 --> 00:54:05.335
They sure picked a fancy spot.

00:54:05.335 --> 00:54:07.546
So what's the emergency?

00:54:12.758 --> 00:54:14.475
Aren't you going to feed me sashimi?

00:54:14.475 --> 00:54:16.597
Sashimi happens to be my favorite.

00:54:20.467 --> 00:54:21.676
This is unreal.

00:54:21.676 --> 00:54:24.355
It's fresh and the texture's killer.

00:54:24.355 --> 00:54:26.774
Please dig in already.

00:54:28.268 --> 00:54:30.178
Look, I should be...

00:54:30.178 --> 00:54:31.989
Wrapping some up for you.

00:54:31.989 --> 00:54:33.548
How about we get to it now?

00:54:33.548 --> 00:54:35.908
What's this urgent thing you came for?

00:54:36.508 --> 00:54:38.770
Well, see...

00:54:38.770 --> 00:54:41.359
It's all sorted out.

00:54:41.359 --> 00:54:42.608
Already?

00:54:42.608 --> 00:54:44.776
You drove all the way out here

00:54:44.776 --> 00:54:46.194
for something that easy?

00:54:46.194 --> 00:54:49.004
Quick fix is a good thing, isn't it?

00:54:51.050 --> 00:54:52.363
Here.

00:54:56.217 --> 00:54:58.793
Eat up yourself.

00:54:58.793 --> 00:55:01.010
Don't be cold.

00:55:10.014 --> 00:55:12.509
You've got quite the appetite.

00:55:12.509 --> 00:55:15.473
Tell me you didn't really come for the sashimi.

00:55:15.473 --> 00:55:17.199
Oh come on,

00:55:17.199 --> 00:55:18.855
here, take some.

00:55:18.855 --> 00:55:20.615
Eat up.

00:55:20.615 --> 00:55:22.442
Don't drink soju on an empty stomach.

00:55:22.442 --> 00:55:25.255
Or have a drink with me, here.

00:55:25.255 --> 00:55:26.917
Cheers!

00:55:36.258 --> 00:55:37.894
That hits the spot.

00:55:37.894 --> 00:55:40.474
Why'd you take a half day so suddenly?

00:55:40.474 --> 00:55:43.001
Everyone's freaking out when you do that.

00:55:43.001 --> 00:55:46.546
Heading back to the office like this after the executive meeting?

00:55:46.546 --> 00:55:48.467
Weird rumors would start flying.

00:55:48.467 --> 00:55:49.808
Got it.

00:55:51.676 --> 00:55:54.509
Anyway, since it's sorted, let's eat up and head out.

00:55:54.509 --> 00:55:55.634
Let's take our time.

00:55:55.634 --> 00:55:59.008
MD Jeon told us to come back slowly anyway.

00:55:59.008 --> 00:56:00.893
Just...

00:56:00.893 --> 00:56:02.427
look at this place.

00:56:02.427 --> 00:56:05.372
It's been a while since I've seen the ocean.

00:56:07.384 --> 00:56:09.293
It's like a date.

00:56:16.412 --> 00:56:19.637
You really keep it simple.

00:56:27.175 --> 00:56:28.614
Exactly.

00:56:28.614 --> 00:56:30.924
So just give me a simple answer.

00:56:30.924 --> 00:56:31.965
Answer to what?

00:56:31.965 --> 00:56:33.609
The thing earlier.

00:56:34.967 --> 00:56:36.720
Where you cut yourself off.

00:56:36.720 --> 00:56:40.259
<i>About that question you asked...</i>

00:56:40.259 --> 00:56:43.202
<i>The real reason behind pushing you away.</i>

00:56:46.064 --> 00:56:47.486
<i>I...</i>

00:56:52.050 --> 00:56:54.046
Oh, that.

00:57:04.332 --> 00:57:06.183
The thing is...

00:57:21.841 --> 00:57:23.800
It slipped my mind.

00:57:23.800 --> 00:57:24.967
What I was about to say...

00:57:24.967 --> 00:57:27.596
It's totally gone, my head's all over the place.

00:57:28.189 --> 00:57:30.085
Maybe I'll try some sashimi.

00:57:32.491 --> 00:57:34.611
This really is delicious.

00:57:34.611 --> 00:57:36.911
Eat plenty. Should we get spicy stew?

00:57:36.911 --> 00:57:39.752
Sir, make the spicy stew nice and fiery.

00:57:39.752 --> 00:57:41.844
Two bowls of rice too.

00:57:43.291 --> 00:57:44.888
Cheers.

00:57:47.875 --> 00:57:49.772
Looks like your glass is empty.

00:57:53.603 --> 00:57:55.190
Cheers.

00:58:07.687 --> 00:58:09.258
No way, at the cafe?

00:58:09.258 --> 00:58:11.403
I nearly had a heart attack.

00:58:11.403 --> 00:58:13.151
In front of everyone too.

00:58:13.151 --> 00:58:14.717
He came at me like he'd throw a punch.

00:58:14.717 --> 00:58:17.254
Then just dropped to his knees.

00:58:18.220 --> 00:58:21.091
I can picture the look on your face.

00:58:34.761 --> 00:58:36.523
Watch it.

00:58:39.722 --> 00:58:42.237
The nerve on you.

00:58:44.967 --> 00:58:46.501
Hands off.

00:58:46.501 --> 00:58:48.660
You're the one who tripped.

00:58:49.550 --> 00:58:51.814
"You"?

00:58:51.814 --> 00:58:54.041
You're really pushing it...

00:59:07.917 --> 00:59:10.132
Did it really slip your mind?

00:59:11.050 --> 00:59:13.477
What you were about to tell me.

00:59:15.676 --> 00:59:18.273
Why can't you just be straight with me?

00:59:25.425 --> 00:59:26.728
You!

00:59:26.728 --> 00:59:28.592
Why'd you come here?

00:59:28.592 --> 00:59:30.702
What's the emergency?

00:59:34.592 --> 00:59:36.959
You lied too, though.

00:59:37.925 --> 00:59:40.002
No, that was...

00:59:40.002 --> 00:59:42.634
It's embarrassing to admit.

00:59:42.634 --> 00:59:45.967
Honestly, I chased you down out of rage.

00:59:45.967 --> 00:59:47.384
I went by your place.

00:59:47.384 --> 00:59:50.008
Saw you getting into MD Jeon's car and got the wrong idea.

00:59:50.008 --> 00:59:53.008
I lost it and floored it all the way here.

00:59:53.008 --> 00:59:54.301
Pretty funny, right?

00:59:54.301 --> 00:59:56.481
It's not like I'm your husband.

00:59:56.481 --> 00:59:58.105
Hold on.

00:59:59.050 --> 01:00:01.358
Me and MD Jeon?

01:00:05.263 --> 01:00:08.161
That's why you called my name in such a scary way.

01:00:08.161 --> 01:00:09.942
You looked ready to throw hands.

01:00:09.942 --> 01:00:12.327
That's why I'm losing it.

01:00:16.550 --> 01:00:19.550
I've kind of snapped.

01:00:19.550 --> 01:00:21.378
All because of you.

01:00:26.996 --> 01:00:29.178
Quit playing dumb.

01:00:30.175 --> 01:00:32.181
The cat's out of the bag.

01:00:34.967 --> 01:00:37.311
I'm into you.

01:00:41.841 --> 01:00:43.696
Hey, look!

01:00:44.923 --> 01:00:46.843
Hey, where are you going?

01:00:46.843 --> 01:00:48.739
Hold on, come over here!

01:00:52.967 --> 01:00:55.204
You said you liked stuffed animals, right?

01:01:03.075 --> 01:01:05.797
Let's win one.

01:01:10.095 --> 01:01:12.429
Grab it!

01:01:26.355 --> 01:01:28.256
You're after that one, aren't you?

01:01:28.256 --> 01:01:29.569
The gold bar's the catch.

01:01:29.569 --> 01:01:32.089
Quite the materialist.

01:01:32.089 --> 01:01:34.314
Step aside, let me give it a shot.

01:01:34.314 --> 01:01:37.191
It's not just random button-mashing.

01:01:37.191 --> 01:01:39.456
There's real technique to it.

01:02:01.717 --> 01:02:03.208
So this...

01:02:04.173 --> 01:02:05.693
Grab...

01:02:05.693 --> 01:02:07.401
this one...

01:02:11.634 --> 01:02:13.282
Right this moment!

01:02:14.425 --> 01:02:16.522
That one won't come out.

01:02:16.522 --> 01:02:18.104
Looking at this machine,

01:02:18.104 --> 01:02:21.583
the claw's grip only holds for about three seconds.

01:02:21.583 --> 01:02:23.401
And that doll's holding a metal bar,

01:02:23.401 --> 01:02:25.836
so the weight's beyond what it can lift.

01:02:26.696 --> 01:02:30.828
A thousand tries, ten thousand tries, no luck.

01:02:31.787 --> 01:02:33.953
It's not about your luck or your skill.

01:02:33.953 --> 01:02:35.715
It's just that.

01:02:36.314 --> 01:02:39.337
The thing's programmed that way.

01:02:39.337 --> 01:02:41.276
Some things won't happen.

01:02:42.133 --> 01:02:44.351
Not in a million years.

01:02:51.342 --> 01:02:53.572
That's my answer to you.

01:02:54.560 --> 01:02:56.366
For me,

01:02:59.983 --> 01:03:01.858
you and I won't work.

01:03:01.858 --> 01:03:04.291
That's just how I'm wired.

01:03:05.758 --> 01:03:09.451
For one, you report to me,

01:03:09.451 --> 01:03:12.633
and that alone is a wall I can't cross.

01:03:15.342 --> 01:03:17.088
And honestly,

01:03:18.122 --> 01:03:21.438
I think you've got your wires crossed.

01:03:21.438 --> 01:03:24.298
It's curiosity, pity, that kind of thing.

01:03:24.298 --> 01:03:25.878
Think about it.

01:03:25.878 --> 01:03:28.720
You learned way too much about me at once.

01:03:28.720 --> 01:03:32.053
You saw me naked, learned my family stuff.

01:03:32.053 --> 01:03:34.151
After seeing all that,

01:03:34.151 --> 01:03:35.826
you started thinking,

01:03:35.826 --> 01:03:38.750
I'm lonelier and sadder than I let on.

01:03:39.425 --> 01:03:41.479
That's what happened.

01:03:41.479 --> 01:03:44.235
Don't put labels on what I feel.

01:03:44.235 --> 01:03:46.583
Either way, that's where it started.

01:03:47.861 --> 01:03:49.709
Can you honestly deny that?

01:03:54.175 --> 01:03:56.108
What's wrong with that?

01:03:56.108 --> 01:03:58.183
Pity, curiosity, whatever.

01:03:58.183 --> 01:04:00.887
Liking someone is liking someone, isn't it?

01:04:00.887 --> 01:04:03.542
Feelings don't come labeled one and two,

01:04:03.542 --> 01:04:06.799
sorted clean like the periodic table.

01:04:06.799 --> 01:04:08.672
Wanting to hold you, wanting to see you,

01:04:08.672 --> 01:04:12.425
feeling sorry, worried, curious,

01:04:12.425 --> 01:04:14.528
even jealous,

01:04:16.841 --> 01:04:19.658
isn't all of that what liking someone feels like?

01:04:26.854 --> 01:04:30.114
Feelings born from pity, I want no part of.

01:04:30.114 --> 01:04:32.627
Nothing's more pathetic.

01:04:33.509 --> 01:04:35.877
Or more clingy than that.

01:04:35.877 --> 01:04:39.136
If you can't accept it, that's not on me.

01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.160
What won't work...

01:04:43.415 --> 01:04:45.312
won't work.

01:05:09.703 --> 01:05:12.904
Wait, you two never fought, not even once?

01:05:12.904 --> 01:05:14.503
That's what I'm telling you.

01:05:14.503 --> 01:05:17.032
Honestly, I acted up plenty.

01:05:17.032 --> 01:05:18.909
My brother always let it slide.

01:05:18.909 --> 01:05:21.094
Glad you noticed.

01:05:23.676 --> 01:05:28.083
You thought he was cute though, right?

01:05:28.083 --> 01:05:30.145
He still is, to me.

01:05:31.755 --> 01:05:34.570
You really do like him.

01:05:36.744 --> 01:05:39.092
Of course, I like him.

01:05:39.092 --> 01:05:40.931
Are you hearing this?

01:05:40.931 --> 01:05:45.994
My brother goes silent at moments like this, can't tell why.

01:05:52.800 --> 01:05:54.961
Come on.

01:06:22.300 --> 01:06:26.260
<i>What won't work, won't work, ever.</i>

01:06:26.260 --> 01:06:28.370
<i>That's the answer I gave.</i>

01:06:47.865 --> 01:06:50.225
Sorry about earlier today.

01:06:53.837 --> 01:06:56.719
You mean getting hit by your wife?

01:06:56.719 --> 01:06:59.106
A bigger paycheck will cover it.

01:07:03.717 --> 01:07:05.831
You doing okay?

01:07:05.831 --> 01:07:07.745
This much is nothing.

01:07:07.745 --> 01:07:11.371
I can take a hit pretty well, I'm fine.

01:07:19.185 --> 01:07:21.697
I thought you were looking at the ocean,

01:07:23.074 --> 01:07:25.007
turns out you were just staring at the dark.

01:07:28.668 --> 01:07:31.691
A pricey ocean view is useless at night.

01:07:31.691 --> 01:07:34.914
Where the sea ends and the sky begins,

01:07:35.512 --> 01:07:37.137
it's all just black.

01:07:38.018 --> 01:07:40.567
You can still feel it though.

01:07:41.384 --> 01:07:44.066
The sea breeze is blowing,

01:07:44.066 --> 01:07:45.978
and the waves are right there.

01:07:57.238 --> 01:07:58.699
I'll head in first.

01:07:58.699 --> 01:08:00.318
Get some rest.

01:08:00.318 --> 01:08:02.005
In Ah.

01:08:09.758 --> 01:08:11.556
Let go.

01:08:12.592 --> 01:08:14.351
Let go of me.

01:08:15.634 --> 01:08:16.958
I said let go.

01:08:16.958 --> 01:08:18.092
Hold on.

01:08:18.092 --> 01:08:19.298
Just a second.

01:08:19.298 --> 01:08:21.399
She told you to let go.

01:08:30.290 --> 01:08:31.893
Let her go.

01:08:40.782 --> 01:08:42.220
See?

01:08:43.910 --> 01:08:46.467
The thing you call impossible...

01:08:46.467 --> 01:08:48.802
it's not so impossible after all.

01:09:41.050 --> 01:09:42.965
<i>The truth is, we go way back.</i>

01:09:42.965 --> 01:09:44.002
<i>It's all over now.</i>

01:09:44.002 --> 01:09:47.261
<i>I know you have feelings for Ms. Joo.</i>

01:09:47.261 --> 01:09:49.300
<i>Are these feelings only on Vice Chairman's side?</i>

01:09:49.300 --> 01:09:53.058
<i>Or is something still alive between you two?</i>

01:09:53.058 --> 01:09:54.883
<i>Don't you have someone like that?</i>

01:09:54.883 --> 01:09:57.271
<i>Someone who'll back you no matter what.</i>

01:09:57.271 --> 01:09:59.082
<i>Acting tough is its own kind of sickness.</i>

01:09:59.082 --> 01:10:01.882
<i>Doing something crazy wouldn't kill you.</i>

01:10:01.882 --> 01:10:04.198
<i>Take all the time you need.</i>

01:10:04.198 --> 01:10:06.947
<i>Look deep into your own heart.</i>

01:10:06.947 --> 01:10:09.037
<i>I'll be right here waiting.</i>

